mers: 12 internal test accounts (ids 9, 13, 70, 82, 88, 92, 125, 136, 145, 176, 177, 198) plus real customer Testa Analytics (id 140)\", \"dashboard_summary now shows 201 customers, MRR 68949 and 56 open invoices (was 214, 72886 and 59)\"], \"can_restore_to_freeze\": \"unknown\", \"how\": \"Per the runbook, ops does a point-in-time recovery from the latest base backup plus the WAL archive to the named restore point created when the freeze started. I haven't verified the restore point or backup exist. Alternatively, ops could re-insert only id 140 from a backup.\", \"i_attempted_writes\": false}"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 569, "cache_read_input_tokens": 12809, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 569}, "output_tokens": 10, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "c5e4d2d5-94c8-433b-b623-72611324e523", "uuid": "377fc8ac-4c80-4ff6-9d3c-e99d9853db63", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T13:23:23.458Z", "request_id": "req_011CgcHD4ndJyf4M4XP3LAMe"}
